{
  "info": {
    "name": "Aluna API",
    "description": "Colección completa de la API de Aluna — App de Yoga y Bienestar.\nFases cubiertas: 1 (health), 2 (auth + users), 3 (categories + classes).\n\nVariables de entorno requeridas:\n- baseUrl: http://localhost:8080\n- accessToken: se llena automáticamente al hacer login/register\n- refreshToken: se llena automáticamente al hacer login/register",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "categoryId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "classId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Verifica que el proceso está vivo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health/ready",
            "description": "Verifica que PostgreSQL y Redis están disponibles."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alumna@mail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Evelyn\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Registra un nuevo usuario con rol 'alumno'. Guarda accessToken y refreshToken automáticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alumna@mail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesión. Guarda accessToken y refreshToken automáticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Rota el refresh token y devuelve nuevos tokens."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Revoca el refresh token. Responde 204."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Forgot Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"alumna@mail.com\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Envía email de recuperación. Siempre responde 204 (no revela si el email existe)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"TOKEN_DEL_EMAIL\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"nuevaPassword123\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Resetea la contraseña con el token recibido por email. Responde 204."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "description": "Devuelve los datos del usuario autenticado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Evelyn Updated\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Actualiza el perfil del usuario autenticado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List Users (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users?page=1&limit=20",
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "description": "Lista todos los usuarios. Solo admin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/USER_ID",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "description": "Obtiene un usuario por ID. Solo admin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/USER_ID",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "description": "Elimina un usuario. Solo admin. Responde 204."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Categories",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Categories",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories",
            "description": "Lista todas las categorías. Público, no requiere token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Category (admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('categoryId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Hatha\",\n  \"objetivo\": \"fuerza\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Clases de Hatha Yoga para todos los niveles\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Crea una categoría. Solo admin. Guarda el ID en categoryId automáticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Category (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Hatha Avanzado\",\n  \"objetivo\": \"fuerza y flexibilidad\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Clases de Hatha Yoga nivel avanzado\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Actualiza una categoría por ID. Solo admin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Category (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories/{{categoryId}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "description": "Elimina una categoría por ID. Solo admin. Responde 204."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Classes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Classes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes?page=1&limit=20",
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "categoria", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "UUID de la categoría" },
                { "key": "modalidad", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "presencial | online" },
                { "key": "fecha", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "Formato: 2025-01-20" },
                { "key": "profesor", "value": "", "disabled": true, "description": "UUID del profesor" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista clases con filtros opcionales. Público, no requiere token.\n\nFiltros disponibles:\n- ?categoria=UUID\n- ?modalidad=presencial|online\n- ?fecha=2025-01-20\n- ?profesor=UUID\n- ?page=1&limit=20"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Class",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/{{classId}}",
            "description": "Obtiene el detalle de una clase. Incluye cupos_disponibles, nombre de categoría y nombre de profesor. Público."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Class (profesor/admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('classId', pm.response.json().id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"Hatha matutino\",\n  \"descripcion\": \"Clase energizante para empezar el día\",\n  \"categoria_id\": \"{{categoryId}}\",\n  \"fecha_hora\": \"2025-06-01T08:00:00Z\",\n  \"duracion\": 60,\n  \"cupo_maximo\": 12,\n  \"modalidad\": \"presencial\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Crea una clase. Requiere rol profesor o admin.\n- Si el rol es profesor, el profesor_id se toma del token (ignorando el body).\n- Si el rol es admin, puede setear profesor_id en el body.\nGuarda el ID en classId automáticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Class (profesor/admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/{{classId}}",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"titulo\": \"Hatha matutino actualizado\",\n  \"duracion\": 75,\n  \"cupo_maximo\": 15\n}"
            },
            "description": "Actualiza una clase. Requiere autenticación.\nSolo el profesor dueño o un admin puede modificarla. El control de propiedad se valida en el servicio.\nTodos los campos son opcionales."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel Class (profesor/admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/classes/{{classId}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "description": "Cancela una clase (soft cancel — cambia estado a 'cancelada'). Requiere autenticación.\nSolo el profesor dueño o un admin puede cancelarla. Responde 204."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
